repository-code: "https://github.com/arnavk23/Quantum-active-learning"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - active learning
  - materials discovery
  - quantum-inspired algorithms
  - uncertainty quantification
  - negative result
abstract: >-
  Implementation and evaluation of a covariance-aware quantum-inspired
  uncertainty formalism for active learning in materials discovery. Includes
  a rigorous, real-data (Materials Project) benchmark against nine standard
  active-learning baselines, an ablation study, and an observable-sensitivity
  sweep. The accompanying paper reports this as a negative result: the
  formalism does not outperform standard baselines, and diagnoses why.
